      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto-aktualizacja CRM\n\n**Trigger:** Webhook — dowolne źródło danych (formularz, e-mail, czat).\n\n**Do zrobienia:**\n1. Podmień \"Zapisz/Aktualizuj w CRM\" na realny endpoint (HubSpot/Pipedrive/Salesforce).\n2. Zmapuj pola w węźle Set na strukturę Twojego CRM.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b540564c-412f-447d-a42b-6fef547f9659",
      "name": "Nowe dane kontaktu (Webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "dane-kontaktu",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1749faf4-d4f5-4176-b6bf-0b9db4a0fdc7",
      "name": "Zmapuj pola",
